      "id": "concept_6",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Month changes must be converted consistently.\n\nIf an 11-player team's average age rises by 2 months, total age rises by 22 months.\nThat is 1 year 10 months.\n\nWhen two players are replaced, add that total change to the old pair's combined age to get the new pair's combined age.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
