      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Age averages are total ages divided by people.\n\nIf membership is unchanged, the average rises by exactly the years that pass.\nWhen someone joins, leaves, is born or is replaced, update the count and total at that event.\nFor month changes, keep all time units consistent before calculating.",
